    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "City Homes are Dublin 12's local estate agents and we are delighted to offer number 13 Lisle Road to the open market for sale.  This is an impressively sized 4 bedroom semi-detached property with 3 bathrooms.  While this home will require some upgrading & modernisation works it presents huge potential to its new owners to create a spacious forever home within a sought after village setting.\r\nThe internal accommodation comprises of a long entrance hallway, a front lounge room, an enlarged main reception room, an extended fitted kitchen, an internal hallway, 4 double bedrooms (2 upstairs & 2 downstairs) and 3 bathrooms (1 upstairs & 2 downstairs).\r\nTo the front there is off-street car parking for multiple cars and side access leads to a garden with large outhouses that can be retained or cleared to create further garden space.  We are advised the the property is vacant in excess of 2 years and will likely qualify for the vacant homes grant.\r\nThis property is located on the edge of Crumlin village which boasts a wealth of local amenities, shops, bars & eateries.  Within a very short walk you will find the parklands and walkways of William Pearse Park and in the vicinity there are a choice of well established junior & senior level schools.  The city centre is just 4.7km from the doorstep and easily accessible with a selection of reliable bus routes in operation close by.  For location farther afield the M50 motorway is just 7 minutes drive away.\r\n**BER report is pending and will be provided soon**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION  **please see floor plan for dimensions\r\nHallway\r\n*A long entrance hallway with tiled flooring and under-stairs storage\r\nLounge 1\r\n*A front reception room / TV room\r\nLounge 2\r\n*An enlarged main reception room towards the rear and leading to the kitchen\r\nKitchen / Dining\r\nA sizeable fitted kitchen with a 6 seater dining area and direct access to the back garden\r\nInternal hallway\r\n*A long dividing room with the rear extended portion\r\nBedroom 1\r\n*A double bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2\r\n*A double bedroom with a part-separate ensuite shower room\r\nBathroom 1\r\n*A fully tiled bathroom suite\r\nBedroom 3\r\n*A large double bedroom to the front with fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 4\r\n*A sizeable double bedroom to the rear with fitted wardrobes\r\nBathroom 3\r\n*A fully tiled shower room suite with Triton instant electric shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "1. A spacious 4 bedroom / 3 bathroom semi-detached home (130m2 / 1,400ft2)\r\n2. Excellent high yield investment option \r\n3. 2 x reception rooms\r\n4. Side access to the rear with additional outhouses\r\n5. Off-street car parking for multiple cars\r\n6. GFCH\r\n7. VACANT HOMES GRANT - subject to conditions\r\n8. An abundance of amenities and facilities within a sought after village setting\r\n9. Easy access into the city centre (c.4.7km away)\r\n10. M50 motorway just 7 minutes walk away"
      },
      {
